'''Dark Purple Dye''' is a {{Legendary}} [[Dye]].

== Obtaining ==
A '''Dark Purple Dye''' has a base {{Chance|0.25%|1|400}} chance of appearing in Rounds {{Green|1}}, {{Green|3}}, or {{Green|4}} of the [[Dark Auction]] with a starting price of {{C|20m}}.

{{Dye Drop Chance|0.25|alt=chance of appearing}}

== Usage ==
'''Dark Purple Dye''' can be applied to any vanilla [[Armor]] piece by combining the two items in an {{Item|Anvil}} to change the hex color of that piece to  {{Color Display|301934}}. It costs {{Bits|100}} to combine the two items.

It can also be donated to {{NPCSprite|Vincent}} to obtain a {{Item|Bucket of Dye}} with a texture unique to its color.

